{
    "title": "Last Land: War of Survival",
    "description": "Are you prepared to lead your allies into a global battlefield where survival is the only option? Are you a master of strategic defense or an audacious attacker? Do you possess the wisdom to thrive with limited resources and lead an empire to its pinnacle? Aspire to be the ruler who dominates the world through legendary battles? Join the epic adventure with Last Land: War of Survival and immerse yourself in a world of relentless challenges and heroic triumphs!\r\nEnter Last Land: War of Survival, a world filled with intense challenges and epic battles! Forge alliances globally, showcase your strategic skills, and lead your army to victory. With support for 16 languages, connect with players worldwide effortlessly, strategize effectively, and dominate the battlefield!\r\n{Game Features}\r\n\r\n>>Shape the Realm's Destiny as Guardians of the Kingdom!\r\nInnovate and train the Lion King, crafting your kingdom's fate with strategic decisions. Overcome challenges, ascend the ranks, and seize unparalleled power and prestige!\r\n\r\n>>Unearth the Secrets of Atlantis in the Battle for Dominance!\r\nAs the legendary city of Atlantis emerges, factions rally their forces. Engage in fierce battles to claim territories abundant with invaluable resources and power.\r\n\r\n>>Summon Legendary Heroes to Lead Your Campaigns!\r\nRecruit history's most iconic figures, from Alexander the Great to Genghis Khan. Write your own epic tale as you march alongside these legendary war chiefs!\r\n\r\n>>Forge Unbreakable Bonds with Enchanting beauties!\r\nExperience cutting-edge 3D visuals with captivating beauties by your side. Embark on unforgettable adventures and forge bonds that transcend realms!\r\n\r\n>>Discover and Wield Ancient Artifacts of Immense Power!\r\nEmbark on a legendary quest to unearth artifacts like the sword of Tyrael and the Trojan horse. Harness their unparalleled power and change the course of battles!\r\n\r\n>>Harness Magic Mines for High Stakes and Grand Rewards!\r\nEngage in strategic alliance investments in magic mines. Stake your claim and enjoy rewards that multiply, promising an exhilarating journey of risk and reward!\r\n\r\n>>Claim Your Territory in Tower Turmoil!\r\nEngage in intense tower battles, secure your position, and strengthen your domain for the ultimate showdown!\r\n\r\n>>Conquer the Throne in Epic Throne Wars!\r\nOvercome challenges, ascend the ranks of power, and seize the throne that signifies unparalleled prestige and dominion!\r\n\r\nJoin the global battlefield of Last Land: War of Survival and etch your name in the annals of history as a true warlord! Are you ready to conquer?\r\n\r\n{Join our global player community}\r\n\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/clashofempire.lemegames\r\nYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMIxd67Sx6ZW0Tprom2ck-Q\r\nIns: https://www.instagram.com/clashofempire_globalwar/\r\n\r\n>>When you encounter any issues, you can submit feedback to our customer service system through the in-game help center (the entrance is next to the castle wall).\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://coe.leme.hk.cn/privacy.htm\r\nService Policy: https://coe.leme.hk.cn/services.htm",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you prepared to lead your allies into a global battlefield where survival is the only option? Are you a master of strategic defense or an audacious attacker? Do you possess the wisdom to thrive with limited resources and lead an empire to its pinnacle? Aspire to be the ruler who dominates the world through legendary battles? Join the epic adventure with Last Land: War of Survival and immerse yourself in a world of relentless challenges and heroic triumphs!<br>Enter Last Land: War of Survival, a world filled with intense challenges and epic battles! Forge alliances globally, showcase your strategic skills, and lead your army to victory. With support for 16 languages, connect with players worldwide effortlessly, strategize effectively, and dominate the battlefield!<br>{Game Features}<br><br>&gt;&gt;Shape the Realm&#39;s Destiny as Guardians of the Kingdom!<br>Innovate and train the Lion King, crafting your kingdom&#39;s fate with strategic decisions. Overcome challenges, ascend the ranks, and seize unparalleled power and prestige!<br><br>&gt;&gt;Unearth the Secrets of Atlantis in the Battle for Dominance!<br>As the legendary city of Atlantis emerges, factions rally their forces. Engage in fierce battles to claim territories abundant with invaluable resources and power.<br><br>&gt;&gt;Summon Legendary Heroes to Lead Your Campaigns!<br>Recruit history&#39;s most iconic figures, from Alexander the Great to Genghis Khan. Write your own epic tale as you march alongside these legendary war chiefs!<br><br>&gt;&gt;Forge Unbreakable Bonds with Enchanting beauties!<br>Experience cutting-edge 3D visuals with captivating beauties by your side. Embark on unforgettable adventures and forge bonds that transcend realms!<br><br>&gt;&gt;Discover and Wield Ancient Artifacts of Immense Power!<br>Embark on a legendary quest to unearth artifacts like the sword of Tyrael and the Trojan horse. Harness their unparalleled power and change the course of battles!<br><